 about space wizards; it’s a masterclass in mindset and manifestation.\nWith the recent buzz around the “Tales of the Empire” release and the ongoing hype for “The Acolyte,” the Force is feeling stronger than ever in 2026. Seeing the legacy of the Jedi continue to evolve just proves that these lessons are timeless. Whether you’re grinding at the gym, locked in on a project, or just trying to find your path, Yoda’s philosophy is the ultimate blueprint for success. Stop hesitating and start executing with that Grand Master energy. Let’s stop making excuses and start making moves that would make the Council proud. The galaxy is yours for the taking if you just stop trying and start doing. May the Force be with you always. 🧘‍♂️⚔️✨🪐🔥\n#starwarsday #maythe4thbewithyou #yodawisdom#theforce starwar", "duration": 24.682, "timestamp": 1777893522, "uploader_id": "61149313492", "uploader": "LSG", "channel": "hi.lsg", "like_count": 312714, "comment_count": 523, "comments": [{"author": "ig_talesofjdl", "author_id": "62513258649", "id": "18101137925046674", "text": "💯", "timestamp": 1779038623}, {"author": "traethebarber", "author_id": "465866990", "id": "18033864494652880", "text": "Wise words from Master Yoda indeed! May his timeless wisdom guide us on our own paths to success", "timestamp": 1779032032}, {"author": "elmer_21574", "author_id": "52984966032", "id": "18074916659401397", "text": "My dad says “do it or don’t never try” I think he got that from yoda", "timestamp": 1778596988}, {"author": "david_alfata", "author_id": "2381588898", "id": "18090709868091756", "text": "NO 🗣️👹", "timestamp": 1778593957}, {"author": "_ulitochnik_", "author_id": "1503023940", "id": "18007126055910671", "text": "Yoda should’ve trained anakin", "timestamp": 1778588287}, {"author": "j_man987", "author_id": "383341740", "id": "18102658580062532", "text": "", "timestamp": 1778587548}, {"author": "lucasn22300", "author_id": "69944678762", "id": "17889175365525674", "text": "Star wars is the best t